  "_comment": "Daily 06:15 and on the app's 'ซิงค์ราคาตอนนี้' button (SYNC_WEBHOOK_URL = this webhook's production URL; header auth = the RFQ integration token). Reads COST UPDATE 2021 for import '2021'!A3:AQ, then the optional tabs 'relationship'!A2:AA (set costs, column K) and 'WHOLESALE'!A1:M (NON PC net prices, column M of the DisplayinUPC = TRUE row) in their own nodes that continue on error (a missing tab is reported to the app, which alerts the owner), SMG PRICELIST NATIONWIDE 'Pricelist update'!A2:I and the newest 'SMG MASTER <period>' file (MASTER!A1:Y incl. the per-item GP columns K–O, T–V, Y; HOTPRICE!A1:G), then posts them to /api/integrations/import/smg_catalog?priceList=<period>. The app checks every header row, refuses an unknown period (create it first in ตั้งค่า → รอบราคา) and replaces that period's EVE/Evercook/Excel products in one transaction. Replace PUT_*_FILE_ID_HERE, rfq.example.com and the credentials. Second branch: reads the Customer Price Mapping Template (Term Library, Customer Groups A:I incl. GP Tier, Group Terms, Channel Map, Customer Map, Active Customers from row 6) and posts it to /api/integrations/import/customer_pricing, which replaces the customer price lookup data. Replace PUT_MAPPING_FILE_ID_HERE. Each import also sends the spreadsheet IDs (files) for the app's data sources page."
